'''Guerrilla Stages''' are a group of [[Special Events|Event Stages]] and chapters always available for a few hours on specific days and times.

==XP Guerrilla Stages==
*[[XP Stage|XP Stage/Weekend Stage]] (Japan: ゲリラ経験値にゃ！), an event including 6 stages.
*[[XP Megablitz]] (Japan: 超ゲリラ経験値), an event stage that was added in the [[Version 3.5 Update]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou]].
*[[Tempered in Flame (Deadly)|XP Colosseum]] (Japan: 経験値は超極上の味 極ムズ), an event stage that was added in the [[Version 5.6 Update]].
*[[Merciless XP!|Merciless XP]] (Japan: 経験値は至高の味), an event stage that was added in the [[Version 6.5 Update]] and was originally named Deadly XP!
*[[XP Bonanza!]] (Japan: 超極悪ゲリラ経験値にゃ), an event including 3 stages.

